                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a nice game especially for the price.   Its a simple fun little game. There is some thinking and strategy involved.  The AI has actually beaten me a couple times on normal difficutly which is extremely rare. It has worked great on my computer and was easy to learn.  It is a good edition to a library because sometimes you only have an hour to relax and play.  I have other games much more in depth.  Often the wife will say go play one game and dinner will be done in an hour.  Most of my games take two weeks to finish so at least with this one I can make it down to dinner. Plus there just arent many Civil War games out there.  I really liked, mid 1990's, Civil War I and II by Sierra and Sid Meiers Gettysburg it would be great if Steam could sell these so I could play them again.",
